  "name": "FigTreeKit",
  "description": "A Python library for programmatic styling of phylogenetic trees for FigTree visualization. FigTreeKit provides a clean API to generate publication-ready Nexus files with full FigTree annotation support, including branch coloring, clade highlighting, custom fonts, and all layout options.",
